<title>USA: SIS Bancorp sees $7.5 mln gain in Q3.</title>
<headline>SIS Bancorp sees $7.5 mln gain in Q3.</headline>
<dateline>SPRINGFIELD, Mass 1996-09-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>SIS Bancorp Inc said on Tuesday that it expected to see a total tax-related one-time gain of about $7.5 million, or $1.37 a share fully diluted, in the third quarter.</p>
</text>
